9️⃣ 🔄 Deep Link از Share Target

در share.js، بخش search-explorer را به‌روز کنید:

```javascript
// Search explorer
document.getElementById('action-search-explorer')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
  const detected = document.getElementById('share-detected');
  const value = detected?.dataset.detectedValue || sharedData?.text || sharedData?.url || '';
  const q = encodeURIComponent(value);
  window.location.href = `./explorer.html?q=${q}`;
});
```

و در explorer.js، در init() این را اضافه کنید:

```javascript
// Deep link: ?q=...
const params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
const q = params.get('q');
if (q) {
  input.value = q;
  input.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'));
  setTimeout(() => form.dispatchEvent(new Event('submit')), 300);
}
```

